            alt="Fishing in Tierra del Fuego"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="journal-card-body">
            <p class="journal-kicker">Tierra del Fuego, Winter 2025</p>
            <h3>Fishing to Belong</h3>
            <p>On sustainability, respect, and why we don't fish just to catch, but to feel part of something greater.</p>
